{"step_index":117,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:21:31Z","content":"I have all the research data. Let me give you the complete answer now.\n\nPriyanshu, here's everything you asked — Mac Mini configs, pricing, forced storage situations, and the bigger machines above it.\n\n---\n\n## Mac Mini — Current Lineup (September 2026)\n\nThe Mac Mini now comes in **two chip tiers**: **M6** and **M5 Pro**.\n\n### The Critical Thing You Need to Know First\n\n| Chip | Max RAM Possible | Can You Get 512GB SSD? |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| **Mac Mini M6** | **32GB max** | ✅ Yes, 512GB is the base storage |\n| **Mac Mini M5 Pro** | **64GB max** | ✅ Yes, 512GB with any RAM config (not forced into 1TB) |\n\n**So: if you want 48GB or 64GB RAM, you MUST buy the M5 Pro model.** The M6 Mac Mini physically cannot go above 32GB.\n\n**Good news on storage:** Apple does NOT force you to buy 1TB with higher RAM configs. You can get 48GB/512GB or 64GB/512GB on the M5 Pro. This is a CTO (Configure-to-Order) option on apple.com/in.\n\n---\n\n## Pricing — India (₹)\n\n| Configuration | Chip | RAM | Storage | India Price (MRP) |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| **Mac Mini base** | M6 | 16GB | 256GB | **₹99,900** |\n| **Mac Mini M6 upgraded** | M6 | 16GB | 512GB | ~₹1,09,900 |\n| **Mac Mini M6 maxed** | M6 | **32GB** | 512GB | ~₹1,39,900 – ₹1,49,900 (est.) |\n| | | | | |\n| **Mac Mini M5 Pro base** | M5 Pro | 24GB | 512GB | **₹2,09,900** |\n| **Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB** | M5 Pro | **48GB** | 512GB | ~₹2,59,900 – ₹2,69,900 (est.) |\n| **Mac Mini M5 Pro 64GB** | M5 Pro | **64GB** | 512GB | ~₹2,99,900 – ₹3,19,900 (est.) |\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **The 48GB and 64GB RAM upgrade prices are estimates** based on Apple's global upgrade pricing pattern (~\\$200/₹20,000 per RAM tier step). The exact India CTO prices are only visible when you go to [apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac/mac-mini](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac/mac-mini), select M5 Pro, and configure it. I could not scrape the exact numbers from the store page. **Check there before buying.**\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Education pricing saves ₹11,000–₹12,000.** M6 starts at ₹8\n<truncated 2442 bytes>\nThat's the full, unquantized frontier model running locally. But at ₹6.3L+ it's not a casual purchase.\n\n---\n\n## Your Decision Map (Based on Your Use Cases)\n\n| Your Use Case | Minimum Config | Recommended Config | Why |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| **Whisper transcription** | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Whisper fits easily in 32GB, fan keeps it running at full speed |\n| **Local LLMs (7B-14B)** | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Sweet spot for daily AI chat/scripting |\n| **Local LLMs (30B-34B)** | Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB | Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB | 270 GB/s bandwidth = much faster tok/s than M6 |\n| **Local LLMs (70B)** | Mac Mini M5 Pro 64GB | Mac Mini M5 Pro 64GB | Only config that fits 70B Q4 with headroom |\n| **RAG pipelines** | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB | More RAM = bigger document indexes + larger context |\n| **QLoRA fine-tuning (7B)** | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Mac Mini M5 Pro 48GB | Training needs more RAM than inference |\n| **Upwork coding/dev** | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Overkill for coding, Docker, multiple IDEs |\n| **YouTube editing + AI** | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Mac Mini M6 32GB | Fan means no throttling on exports |\n\n---\n\n## The Bottom Line\n\n**If your budget is ₹1.3-1.5L:** Mac Mini M6 with 32GB/512GB. Best value AI machine Apple sells. Fan-cooled, no throttling, runs 7B-14B models all day. Massive upgrade over your Air for sustained workloads.\n\n**If your budget is ₹2.5-2.7L:** Mac Mini M5 Pro with 48GB/512GB. The \"serious AI\" machine. 270 GB/s bandwidth, runs 30B models, proper fine-tuning capability. This is where the Mac Mini becomes a genuine local AI workstation.\n\n**If your budget is ₹3.0-3.2L:** Mac Mini M5 Pro with 64GB/512GB. Run 70B models locally. This is the config ML engineers and AI researchers buy.\n\n**Don't forget:** Go to [apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac/mac-mini](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac/mac-mini) and configure it yourself to see the exact final price. My 48GB and 64GB prices are estimates. And use education pricing if you can — it saves ₹11-12K.","thinking":"The user wants me to continue from where I was interrupted. I was researching Mac Mini pricing for 32GB, 48GB, and 64GB configurations with 512GB storage, plus the \"bigger versions\" (Mac Studio, Mac Pro). I have all the data I need now. Let me compile the answer directly.\n\nFrom my research:\n\n**Current Mac Mini lineup (Sep 2026):**\n- Mac Mini M6: starts ₹99,900 (16GB/256GB or 512GB base)\n  - Max RAM: 32GB\n  - 32GB upgrade adds ~$400 USD\n- Mac Mini M5 Pro: starts ₹2,09,900 (24GB/512GB base)\n  - Max RAM: 64GB, with 48GB and 64GB options available\n\nThe M6 maxes out at 32GB, so for 48GB or 64GB the M5 Pro is required — and 512GB storage is available across all RAM tiers without being forced into 1TB. For bigger machines, the Mac Studio M5 Max starts at ₹2,79,900 (48GB base, up to 128GB), and the M5 Ultra starts around ₹6,29,900 with 256GB base.\n\nNow I'm estimating rough India pricing for various Mac Mini configurations — base M6 at 32GB, and M5 Pro tiers at 24GB, 48GB, and 64GB, noting these RAM-upgrade figures are approximate since I don't have exact official numbers.\n\nI should be upfront that exact CTO pricing for India is only available through Apple's own configurator, which I can't scrape directly, so I'll present the USD figures I found alongside India base prices and flag what remains unverified.\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
