{"step_index":93,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-01T11:39:53Z","content":"Transcription samajh gaya. Let me break down every point and research each one properly.","thinking":"Now I have the transcription. Let me understand what the user is asking:\n\n1. **NVIDIA eGPU with MacBook** - Can I add an NVIDIA GPU to MacBook? How fast will it be? Will it really help? How much will it cost? What about power/cooling?\n2. **MacBook Air + Mac mini combo** - Is this a better alternative? Mac mini handles power/cooling better\n3. **Full research needed** - Don't skip anything, do complete research before deciding to buy MacBook Air\n4. **Second-hand/refurbished is fine** - Will buy from anywhere, doesn't matter, as long as it's good\n5. **Core concern** - If they can't run LLMs or learn RAG/CS on this machine, then what's the point?\n6. **Core concern** - I should flag that Apple actually dropped eGPU support entirely with Apple Silicon, so pairing an NVIDIA card with any M-series MacBook isn't possible — I need to verify and be upfront about this. I also want to look into whether a Mac mini (M5 if available) would be a stronger choice given its active cooling and RAM/pricing options, and compare 16GB vs 32GB configurations for RAG workloads.\n\nThen there's the genuinely interesting question of whether a Mac mini plus MacBook Air combo makes more sense than just getting a single 32GB MacBook Air — that deserves a real cost/benefit breakdown rather than a quick answer.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"can you use NVIDIA external GPU eGPU with MacBook Air M5 Apple Silicon 2025 2026 Thunderbolt\"","toolAction":"\"Searching eGPU compatibility\"","toolSummary":"\"NVIDIA eGPU with MacBook\""}},{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"Mac mini M5 price India specifications RAM options 2026 vs MacBook Air M5\"","toolAction":"\"Searching Mac mini specs\"","toolSummary":"\"Mac mini M5 India pricing\""}},{"name":"s